XT-ALIGN: center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 90.58pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 85.97pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">기획협력과</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 108.61pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 257.91pt\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"3\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt\"></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">부서장이 지정한 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">행정 업무 지원</span></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 179.84pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 257.91pt\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"3\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\">▪ ’07 ~ ‘10년 대졸자 중 채용</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\">일 기준 순수 미취업자로서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\"> 학사학위 소지자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">(2010년 8월 졸업자 지원 가능)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\">채용일 기준 3개월 내에 취업사실이 있는 자는 제외(단, 비자발적 사유에 의한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\"> 실직자, 단기근로(주당 15시간 이내)자 및 일용근로자는 참여 가능)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\">단, 취업자, 진학자, 입대자, 취업불가능자 또는 정부 실업대책사업의 수혜를 받고 있는 자 등 제외</span></p>\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\"> 학력을 낮추어 지원할 수 없음 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움\">(대학원 졸업자 지원 불가)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 33.98pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 85.97pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 90.58pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 85.97pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">총무과</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 33.98pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 85.97pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 90.58pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 85.97pt\" valign=\"middle\">\n            <p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">국제교류센터</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ 상기 근무부서별 인원은 사정상 변경될 수 있음</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2. 근무조건 </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 신 분 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">공무원의 사무를 보조하는 공무원이 아닌 근로자</span></u></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. 계약기간 : 2010년 9월 ～ 2010년 12월 말</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다. 보수수준 : 약 101만원 수준(4대 보험료 본인부담금 포함) </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">라. 근무시간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">주 40시간근무/1일 8시간(09:00~18:00), 토․일 및 국경일 휴무</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">마. 후생복지 : 4대 보험 가입, 기타 복리후생 적용</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3. 응시자격 및 우대조건</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 교육공무원 임용에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. ‘07 ~ ’10년 대졸자 중 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">채용일 기준 순수 미취업자</span></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">로서 학사학위 소지자</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 16pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">채용일 기준 3개월 내에 취업사실이 있는 자는 제외(단, 비자발적 사유에 의한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 실직자, 단기근로(주당 15시간 이내)자 및 일용근로자는 참여 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 취업자, 진학자, 입대자, 취업불가능자 또는 정부 실업대책사업의 수혜를 받고 있는 자 등 제외, 학력을 낮추어 지원할 수 없음(대학원 졸업자 지원 불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">채용예정일 기준 고용보험에 가입된 자는 지원 불가</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다. 본교 출신, 장애인, 기초생활수급자는 우선 채용</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">라. 타교 출신자 지원 가능 </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">4. 심사방법 및 일정[예정]</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 1차 심사 : 서류전형</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">○ 서류전형 합격자 발표 : 2010. 9. 15(수) 19:00 </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">- 본교 홈페이지(</span><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">http://www.kumoh.ac.kr</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">) 공고 또는 개별 통보 </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. 2차 심사 : 면접시험</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">○ 일시 : 2010. 9. 16(목) 11:00 ~ </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">○ 장소 : 본교 글로벌관 4층 교무연구과 교수지원팀(대기실)</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">○ 서류전형 합격자에 한하여 실시하되, 채용분야 업무 수행에 필요한 능력 및 적격성 검증을 통하여 최종합격자 결정</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다. 최종합격자 발표 : 2010. 9. 16(목) 18:00 </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">○ 본교 홈페이지(</span><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">http://www.kumoh.ac.kr</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">) 공고 또는 개별 통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">5. 원서접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 접수기간 : 2010. 9. 11(토) ～ 9.15(수) 12:00 까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. 접수방법 : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">e-mail</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 접수만 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">○ e-mail : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">mh1981</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">@kumoh.ac.kr</span></u></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ e-mail 제목은 반드시 “인턴조교(성명) [예시 : 인턴조교(홍길동)]”으로 기재</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">6. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 지원서 및 자기소개서 1부(소정양식) : 【붙임1~3】</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. 추천서(해당자에 한함) 1부 : 【붙임4】</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다. 주민등록등본 1부. </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">라. 경력증명서 및 병적증명서 1부(해당자에 한함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 병적증명서는 주민등록초본으로 대체 가능 </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">마. 신원진술서 1부 :【붙임5】</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 신원진술서는 자필로 반드시 작성하며, 사진을 부착할 것(사진파일은 불가) </span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">바. 기본증명서 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">사. 최종학력증명서 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ 「가 ~ 나」호 서류는 원서접수기간에 제출하고, 서류전형합격자에 한해 면접시험 당일「다 ~ 사」호 서류 제출하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">7. 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">가. 지원서 등에 허위기재 또는 기재착오, 구비서류 미제출 등으로 인한 불이익은 지원자 본인의 책임으로 합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">나. 지원 희망자는 자격요건 등이 적합한가를 우선 판단하여 지원서를 접수하기 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">바라며, 제출한 서류는 일체 반환하지 않으며, 기재사항은 수정할 수 없습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다. 지원서나 각종 증명서의 기재내용이 사실과 다르거나 시험에 관한 규정을 위반한 자는 시험을 정지 또는 무효로 하며, 합격을 취소할 수 있습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">라. 지원서 접수결과 응시자가 선발예정인원수와 같거나 미달하더라도 적격자가 없는 경우 선발하지 않을 수 있습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">마. 본 시험계획은 사정에 의하여 변경될 수 있으며, 변경된 사항은 재공고 후 시행할 예정입니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">바. 인턴조교로 선발되더라도 추후 정규 공무원으로 임용하거나 임용시험시 가산점 등의 혜택은 없습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">사. 기타 자세한 사항은 금오공과대학교 교무연구과로(☎ 054-478-7025) 문의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
